lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a cinema, there are 25 movie posters. The ticket seller tells the manager that most of the posters on display are for comedy movies, and a very small part are for romance movies or action movies. After checking, the manager finds that only 3 are for action movies.\n\n[Question]\nHow many action movie posters does the manager guess there are after checking?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. After checking, the manager guesses there are 12 action movie posters.\nB. After checking, the manager guesses there are 22 action movie posters.\nC. After checking, the manager guesses there are 19 action movie posters.\nD. After checking, the manager guesses there are 10 action movie posters.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007577239474994628,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52b23c2ddb05a7fe2fab2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452259947,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:57:39","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"2b7a0a7bb9ff4c3483b173291b49bf21"}